# Styles

Use Tailwind v4 utility classes and shadcn/ui tokens from
`src/app/globals.css`. Do not add a second CSS framework or ad-hoc
global stylesheets.

- Prefer existing `button`, `card`, `dialog`, `input`, `table` primitives.
- Style via `className` + `cn()` (`clsx` + `tailwind-merge`).
- Map colors to semantic tokens (`bg-background`, `text-muted-foreground`,
  `border-border`, `bg-primary`) so light/dark CSS variables keep working.
- Keep the three-panel workspace readable: stepper, chat, Project Brain
  should share spacing and type scale, not custom one-off palettes.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<div style={{ color: "#333", fontFamily: "Inter" }} />

// ✅ GOOD
<div className="text-foreground font-sans">
  <Card className="border bg-card" />
</div>
```
